WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,670
Agree

2
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:02,280
800 is 800 right

3
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:09,900
You need to change your shoes, okay. Let me take a look at your shoes.

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,820
It looks a little old, right?

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:12,900
This pair of shoes is for you

6
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,540
Thank you for your cooperation just now. You look handsome.

7
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:16,660
Is this what it feels like?

8
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:18,140
You can receive a trial anytime and anywhere

9
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,580
I bought clothes here for so long

10
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,220
You didn't even ask me to be a model and gave me money.

11
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,220
Just give money

12
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:25,700
Now I even give you shoes, thank you Brother Xiao

13
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,340
We don’t have to work today, right?

14
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,460
I'm ready to go back

15
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,660
Are you ready to go back? I have to buy rice.

16
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,300
Then you don't need my help, right?

17
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,700
But they only sell rice there

18
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:34,980
Where can I buy meat?

19
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:37,100
I have more than 2,700 yuan now.

20
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,060
I can buy a lot of things over there.

21
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:40,180
There's a market over there

22
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,460
There are a lot of things for sale inside

23
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,780
Including those on sale tomorrow night

24
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:45,100
And it’s cheaper than those stores.

25
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,620
Sure enough, it is a floating land in winter

26
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:48,380
Where the gods live

27
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:50,620
Otherwise, how could there be so many things?

28
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:51,940
And this goes in and out

29
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,540
Everyone seems to be able to afford it

30
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:55,620
This is even how it should be
